...RESPONDENTS  (R.1: SERVED AND UNREPRESENTED;
 BY SRI RAVISH BENNI, ADVOCATE FOR R.2.)
 -2-  NC: 2023:KHC:29167

Hence the following:
ORDER (i) The appeal is disposed of;
(ii) The petitioner is entitled to an enhanced compensation of Rs.35,000/- globally without interest which shall be over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal;
(iii) Respondent No.2-Insurance company shall pay the enhanced compensation within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of the certified copy of the judgment and order;
(iv) Office to draw modified award accordingly.

